WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.084
The stepsisters kept talking about the ball.

2
00:00:08.085 --> 00:00:12.079
"I will wear my favorite jewels," Gert said.

3
00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:15.768
"I'm going to dance with the prince," Trudy said.

4
00:00:15.769 --> 00:00:17.920
"Hmph!" Gert said.

5
00:00:17.921 --> 00:00:20.587
"The prince won't dance with you.

6
00:00:20.588 --> 00:00:23.779
He'll be too busy dancing with me!"

7
00:00:23.780 --> 00:00:27.344
"Girls, girls," Stepmother said.

8
00:00:27.345 --> 00:00:30.991
"The prince will dance with both of you."

9
00:00:30.992 --> 00:00:33.887
"How do you know?" Trudy asked.

10
00:00:33.888 --> 00:00:36.518
Stepmother had a wicked grin.

11
00:00:36.519 --> 00:00:39.571
"The prince is looking for a wife.

12
00:00:39.572 --> 00:00:43.201
So he will dance with all the ladies."

13
00:00:43.202 --> 00:00:48.814
Trudy and Gert clapped with delight.

14
00:00:48.815 --> 00:00:52.837
"You both must impress him," Stepmother said.

15
00:00:52.838 --> 00:00:56.123
"Then he'll want to marry one of you.

16
00:00:56.124 --> 00:01:04.791
And I can move to the palace!"

17
00:01:04.792 --> 00:01:07.692
Later Stepmother found Cinderella.

18
00:01:07.693 --> 00:01:11.037
"You must make pretty gowns for my daughters.

19
00:01:11.038 --> 00:01:18.730
Everything must be perfect!"

20
00:01:18.731 --> 00:01:31.957
Cinderella made two beautiful gowns.

21
00:01:31.958 --> 00:01:35.586
The stepsisters put them on.

22
00:01:35.587 --> 00:01:39.008
"I look lovely!" Trudy said.

23
00:01:39.009 --> 00:01:42.642
"I look lovely too!" Gert said.

24
00:01:42.643 --> 00:01:46.717
Trudy looked at Cinderella.

25
00:01:46.718 --> 00:01:49.541
"Poor Cinderella," she whispered.

26
00:01:49.542 --> 00:01:52.183
"You will miss the ball."

27
00:01:52.184 --> 00:01:55.646
Stepmother spun around. "Hush, Trudy!

28
00:01:55.647 --> 00:01:59.100
Cinderella has work to do!" she yelled.

29
00:01:59.101 --> 00:02:05.951
"She will stay home and scrub floors."

30
00:02:05.952 --> 00:02:11.277
At last it was the night of the ball.

31
00:02:11.278 --> 00:02:17.943
"Good-bye, Cinderella!" the stepsisters called.

32
00:02:17.944 --> 00:02:20.923
Tears slipped from Cinderella's eyes.

33
00:02:20.924 --> 00:02:26.814
She began to sob.

